## Estimates

Regarding the **estimates** that you did for practical tasks...

### How was your estimate accuracy usually?

My estimates were often close but not completely accurate. I tended to underestimate tasks that involved debugging or
unfamiliar libraries.

### How did your estimate accuracy improve or change during the course of the subject?

Throughout the subject, I became better at predicting which tasks would take longer. I started adding buffer time for
reading documentation and testing.

